    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for atypical choroid plexus papilloma</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Cynthia E. Hawkins",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Essential:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Intraventricular or cerebellopontine angle location</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Demonstration of choroid plexus differentiation by histopathological and immunophenotypic features</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Demonstration of &ge;&nbsp;1&nbsp;mitosis/mm<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;in a minimum of 2.3&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;(equating to &ge;&nbsp;2&nbsp;mitoses/10&nbsp;HPF of 0.23&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup>)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Absence of criteria qualifying for the diagnosis of choroid plexus carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Desirable:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>In select cases:</em> demonstration of hyperploidy by genome-wide chromosomal copy-number analysis</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
